        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Dennis Wayne's Dancers, American Ballet Theatre\n- People: Dennis Wayne, Paul Newman, Joanne Woodward\n- Places: New York City\n- Topics: contemporary ballet, classical ballet\n\nFacts:\n- American Ballet Theatre is a classical ballet company based in New York City.\n- In the summer of 1975, Dennis Wayne left American Ballet Theatre.\n- After Dennis Wayne left American Ballet Theatre in the summer of 1975, Dennis Wayne's Dancers was formed as a New York-based contemporary ballet company.\n- Paul Newman and Joanne Woodward founded Dennis Wayne's Dancers around dancer Dennis Wayne.\n- Dennis Wayne's Dancers drew on the talents of many famous dancers and received critical acclaim.",
